/-- Commuting Refused-Return Task Square (`ScopedConfigurationRel.returnRefused_step`):
When `.returned` receives `Atom.notReducible`, both machines step in 1 silent transition
to restore the original call `(original, wB)` / `(ctxOrig, cFrame)` while preserving
